= Past exam of the chemistry course of the year 3 of the natural sciences course of the University of Cambridge

Student suggested answers for the past ten years are available on Chemistry Moodle. https://teaching.ch.cam.ac.uk/files/Start%20of%20Term%20Arrangements/Part%20II%20course%20guide%202025%20.pdf#page=29[Official course guide: past papers and suggested answers] New solutions for years covered by that archive are skipped; existing wiki drafts are retained.

